      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "B93707623A53FE51",
      "text": "真棒！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "B93704623A53F938",
      "text": "好期待！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "060392E58E827F4F",
      "text": "因為才剛剛決定，\\n所以距離正式營運還需要一段時間啦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "060391E58E827D9C",
      "text": "首先我要把\\n海岱俱樂部的名菜佛跳牆\\r\\n改良成適合學生們的菜色！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "060390E58E827BE9",
      "text": "我希望正在發育時期的小朋友們\\n能吃到好東西！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "06038FE58E827A36",
      "text": "……我這輩子一直只是做著我想做的事，\\n結果就走到了食育的圈子來啦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "DE6D182A49C40B17",
      "text": "多虧[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳邀請我到學園來，\\n我自己學到的東西也是大豐收啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "DE6D172A49C40964",
      "text": "哇、哈、哈！\\n我可要好好感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳才行！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
