    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "0AC0F29213BEA483",
      "text": "在生態巨蛋裡\\n堅強地綻放的花朵！\\r\\n珍貴，真是太珍貴了啊……！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
